Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Removes only the forced CPU priority created by the HL priority REG files.
; Other hl.exe IFEO/PerfOptions values, if any, are left untouched.
; Close CS before importing, then launch it again.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\Image File Execution Options\hl.exe\PerfOptions]
"CpuPriorityClass"=-
